@hostname = localhost
@port = 5030
@host = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}

### 1. Get Current Config Values (IOptions vs Snapshot vs Monitor)
GET {{host}}/api/settings
Accept: application/json

# --- HOW TO TEST DYNAMIC UPDATES ---
# 1. Start the API.
# 2. Call GET /api/settings and notice all values are identical.
# 3. Edit OptionsPattern.Api/appsettings.json to change "Port" to 9999 or "SenderName" to "Updated Company".
# 4. Call GET /api/settings again.
# 5. Observe that:
#    - IOptions stays at port 2525 and "My Company" (no update).
#    - IOptionsSnapshot updates to port 9999 / "Updated Company".
#    - IOptionsMonitor updates to port 9999 / "Updated Company".
# 6. Check the API logs to see:
#    "SMTP Settings changed dynamically: Server=smtp.mailtrap.io, Port=9999" (handled by IOptionsMonitor.OnChange)
